Perfect! I've mapped the entire logos package and pipeline. Here's the comprehensive breakdown:

## 1. **Logos Package Location & Structure**

**Path:** [plugins/pantoken/logos/](plugins/pantoken/logos/)

**package.json** ([plugins/pantoken/logos/package.json](plugins/pantoken/logos/package.json)):
- **Name:** `@pantoken/plugin-logos` 
- **Exports:** `./` (index.mjs), `./logos.css`, `./*.css` (per-logo CSS files), `./package.json`
- **Files:** `dist/` + `assets/logos/`
- **Scripts:** 
  - `generate` — runs `scripts/generate.ts` (rebuilds `generated/embedded.ts`, `generated/logos.css`, and per-product/per-logo CSS files)
  - `dev`, `test`, `check`
- **Build:** Vite with `vp pack` (CSS splitting enabled; generates 100+ individual `.css` entries per Vite config)

**Directory structure:**
```
src/
  index.ts              # Exports logos[], products[], logosCss, getLogoSvg(), getLogoDataUri(), logosPlugin()
scripts/
  generate.ts           # Reads SVGs from assets/logos/<product>/<layout>-<mode>.svg and generates TypeScript + CSS
assets/logos/
  canvas/               # 12 logos (horizontal, icon, stacked × 4 color modes)
  igniteai/             # 8 logos (horizontal, icon × 4 color modes)
  instructure/          # 16 logos (horizontal + icon-single-dot + icon-three-dot × various modes + BG variants)
  learnplatform/        # 8 logos (horizontal, icon × 4 color modes)
  mastery/              # 12 logos (horizontal, icon, stacked × 4 color modes)
  pantoken/             # 16 logos (horizontal + reversed, + 11 language variants with -ar, -el, -fa, -he, -hi, -hy, -jp, -ko, -ru, -th, -uk, -zh suffixes)
  parchment/            # 12 logos (horizontal, icon, stacked × 4 color modes)
```

---

## 2. **SVG Storage & Generation**

**Source:** Raw SVG files stored per product, named as `{layout}-{colorMode}{-lang}.svg` (e.g., `horizontal-color.svg`, `horizontal-full-color-ar.svg`).

**Sample viewBox dimensions** (showing how each layout differs):
- **Horizontal** (Canvas): `viewBox="0 0 310.23 78.94"` — wide/short aspect ratio
- **Icon** (Canvas): `viewBox="0 0 271.71 271.8"` — square-ish
- **Icon-single-dot** (Instructure): `viewBox="0 0 209.2 209.2"` — square
- **Icon-three-dot** (Instructure): `viewBox="0 0 212.5 212.5"` — square
- **Stacked** (Parchment): `viewBox="0 0 292.19 159.9"` — wider than tall

**Build-time processing** ([scripts/generate.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/scripts/generate.ts#L1-L300)):
1. Scans `assets/logos/<product>/` for `.svg` files
2. Parses stems using `parseStem()` to extract `{layout, colorMode, lang?}`
3. **Embeds SVG text** into `generated/embedded.ts` as `LOGO_SVGS: Record<string, string>` (raw SVG markup keyed by `"{product}-{layout}-{colorMode}{-lang?}"`)
4. Generates metadata into `LOGOS: LogoMeta[]` array
5. **Creates CSS files:**
   - `logos.css` — `:root` with all `--instui-logo-*` tokens as `url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,…)` data URIs
   - Per-product CSS (e.g., `canvas.css`, `instructure.css`)
   - Per-individual-logo CSS (e.g., `canvas-horizontal-color.css`)

---

## 3. **Complete Data Structure: `logos[]` Export**

**Type definition** ([src/index.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/src/index.ts#L1-L80)):
```typescript
export interface LogoMeta {
  product: Product;              // "canvas" | "igniteai" | "instructure" | "learnplatform" | "mastery" | "pantoken" | "parchment"
  layout: LogoLayout;            // "horizontal" | "icon" | "icon-single-dot" | "icon-three-dot" | "stacked"
  colorMode: LogoColorMode;      // "color" | "dark" | "full-color" | "full-color-bg" | "full-color-reversed" | "light" | "reversed" | "reversed-bg" | "current-color"
  lang?: LogoLang;               // "ar" | "el" | "fa" | "he" | "hi" | "hy" | "jp" | "ko" | "ru" | "th" | "uk" | "zh" (localized wordmark variants only)
  name: string;                  // e.g., "canvas-horizontal-color", "pantoken-horizontal-full-color-ar"
  path: string;                  // e.g., "canvas/horizontal-color.svg"
}

export const logos: readonly LogoMeta[] = LOGOS;
export const products: readonly Product[] = ["canvas", "igniteai", "instructure", "learnplatform", "mastery", "pantoken", "parchment"];
```

**Full sample** (from [generated/embedded.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/generated/embedded.ts#L1-L200)):
```
Canvas: 12 entries (horizontal/icon/stacked × color/dark/full-color/reversed)
Instructure: 16 entries (icon-single-dot + icon-three-dot with -full-color-bg/-reversed-bg variants)
Pantoken: 16 entries (horizontal + reversed, each with 11 language variants)
... ~170 total logos across 7 products
```

**No intrinsic width/height in metadata** — only the `path` string; callers must parse `viewBox` from the SVG text itself using `getLogoSvg()`.

---

## 4. **Current Build: CSS Generation & File Output**

**Vite config** ([plugins/pantoken/logos/vite.config.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/vite.config.ts)):
```typescript
const logoEntries = {
  // Per-product CSS (canvas.css, instructure.css, etc.)
  "canvas": "generated/canvas.css",
  "instructure": "generated/instructure.css",
  // ... 7 products
  // Per-individual-logo CSS (canvas-horizontal-color.css, etc.)
  "canvas-horizontal-color": "generated/canvas-horizontal-color.css",
  "canvas-icon-color": "generated/canvas-icon-color.css",
  // ... ~170 individual logos
};

export default extendBase({
  pack: {
    entry: { index: "src/index.ts", logos: "generated/logos.css", ...logoEntries },
    css: { splitting: true, target: false, minify: true, modules: false, inject: false }
  }
});
```

**Output:** The build produces ~178 CSS files in `dist/`:
- `logos.css` (combined)
- 7 per-product files
- 170+ per-logo files

Each CSS file contains the logo's `--instui-logo-*` token(s) as base64-encoded data URIs, plus `@property` registrations for CSS-API docs.

---

## 5. **TinyMCE Logos Plugin: Full Dialog & Insertion Logic**

**File:** [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts)

**Dialog UI** (lines 60–140):
```typescript
openLogosDialog(editor: Editor, options: LogosPickerOptions) {
  const productItems = options.products.map((p) => ({ text: p, value: p }));

  editor.windowManager.open({
    title: "Insert Logo",
    body: {
      items: [
        { type: "selectbox", name: "product", label: "Product", items: productItems },
        { type: "selectbox", name: "layout", label: "Layout", 
          items: [
            { text: "Horizontal", value: "horizontal" },
            { text: "Vertical", value: "vertical" },      // ← BUG: "vertical" not in real layouts
            { text: "Stacked", value: "stacked" }
          ]
        },
        { type: "selectbox", name: "colorMode", label: "Color Mode",
          items: [
            { text: "Color", value: "color" },
            { text: "Monochrome", value: "monochrome" },  // ← BUG: "monochrome" not in real modes
            { text: "Light", value: "light" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    onSubmit: (api) => {
      const { product, layout, colorMode } = api.getData();
      insertLogo(editor, product, layout, colorMode, options);
      api.close();
    }
  });
}
```

**Alt text generation** (line 215):
```typescript
export function generateLogoHtml(productId: string, layout: string, colorMode: string): string {
  return `<img class="pantoken-logo" 
    data-product="${productId}" 
    data-layout="${layout}" 
    data-color-mode="${colorMode}" 
    src="about:blank" 
    alt="${productId} ${TINYMCE_STRINGS.logoAltSuffix}"   // ← Alt: "canvas logo" or similar
    style="max-width: 200px;" />`;
}
```

**CSS tracking & injection** (line 200–210):
```typescript
export function insertLogo(
  editor: Editor,
  productId: string,
  layout: string,
  colorMode: string,
  options: LogosPickerOptions,
): void {
  const html = generateLogoHtml(productId, layout, colorMode);
  editor.insertContent(html);

  const cssFile: CdnFile = {
    package: "@pantoken/plugin-logos",
    path: `dist/${productId}-${layout}-${colorMode}.css`  // ← Tracks which CSS files were inserted
  };
  trackAndInjectAsset(editor, cssFile, options);          // ← Injects <link> into editor content doc
}
```

**Re-export from tinymce/src/index.ts** (line 43):
```typescript
export type { LogoMeta, Product } from "./logos.js";
export { logos, products } from "./logos.js";
```

---

## 6. **ViewBox Metadata in SVGs** (Key for PNG Sizing)

Every SVG has intrinsic proportions encoded in `viewBox`:

**Sample extracts:**
| Product | Layout | ColorMode | ViewBox | Aspect Ratio |
|---------|--------|-----------|---------|--------------|
| Canvas | horizontal | color | `0 0 310.23 78.94` | 3.93:1 (wide) |
| Canvas | icon | color | `0 0 271.71 271.8` | ~1:1 (square) |
| Canvas | stacked | color | `0 0 184.83 145.08` | 1.27:1 |
| Instructure | icon-single-dot | dark | `0 0 209.2 209.2` | 1:1 (square) |
| Instructure | icon-three-dot | dark | `0 0 212.5 212.5` | 1:1 (square) |
| Parchment | stacked | full-color | `0 0 292.19 159.9` | 1.83:1 |

**Access from code:**
```typescript
import { getLogoSvg } from "@pantoken/plugin-logos";
const svg = getLogoSvg("canvas", "horizontal", "color");
// Extract: <svg viewBox="0 0 310.23 78.94" xmlns="...">...</svg>
const match = svg.match(/viewBox="0 0 ([\d.]+) ([\d.]+)"/);
const [w, h] = match ? [match[1], match[2]] : null;  // → "310.23", "78.94"
```

---

## 7. **CSS Asset Tracking System**

**Content CSS wiring** ([renderers/tinymce/src/content-css.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/content-css.ts#L1-L50)):
```typescript
export function trackAndInjectAsset(
  editor: Editor,
  cssFile: CdnFile,
  target: { currentAssets: CdnFile[]; onMissingAsset?: MissingAssetHandler }
): void {
  if (!target.currentAssets.find((a) => a.path === cssFile.path)) {
    target.currentAssets.push(cssFile);
    target.onMissingAsset?.(cssFile);  // ← Notify caller of new CSS file
  }
  const cssUrl = `https://unpkg.com/${cssFile.package}@latest/${cssFile.path}`;
  injectContentStylesheet(editor, cssUrl);  // ← Idempotent per URL
}
```

**CdnFile shape:**
```typescript
type CdnFile = {
  package: "@pantoken/plugin-logos";
  path: "dist/{productId}-{layout}-{colorMode}.css";
};
```

---

## **Summary for PNG Export Planning**

To build `@pantoken/logos-png`, you'll need:

✅ **Source:** [plugins/pantoken/logos/assets/logos/](plugins/pantoken/logos/assets/logos/) SVG files  
✅ **Metadata:** [generated/embedded.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/generated/embedded.ts) `LOGOS[]` + `LOGO_SVGS` record  
✅ **ViewBox parsing:** Every SVG has `viewBox="0 0 W H"` — extract **W** and **H** to set `<img width height>` on PNG variants  
✅ **CSS build:** Mimic [generate.ts](plugins/pantoken/logos/scripts/generate.ts) to create per-logo CSS with data-URI PNGs  
✅ **TinyMCE integration:** Extend [plugins/logos.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts) dialog to toggle SVG ↔ PNG format  
✅ **Dialog state:** Likely add a "Format" selectbox (SVG/PNG) or separate toolbar buttons  
✅ **Alt text:** Currently `"{productId} logo"` — keep for PNGs; no special dimensions info  

**Next step:** Create the PNG rasterization pipeline extracting dimensions from `viewBox`, then wire PNG CSS generation into a companion plugin.

